OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FPatchy cloud and long sunny
OL,6,Fspells today. Remaining dry, with a
OL,7,Ffresh northeasterly breeze, stronger
OL,8,Falong southern coastlines.
OL,9,FTemperatures around average for the
OL,10,Ftime of year.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FClear spells allow
OL,13,Ftemperatures to drop off tonight, with
OL,14,Fsome mist and fog patches developing
OL,15,Fin prone locations. Remaining breezy
OL,16,Falong southern coasts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
