OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FA bright start around any
OL,6,Fearly mist and fog patches, turning
OL,7,Fcloudier from the east with perhaps
OL,8,Fthe odd light shower later. A moderate
OL,9,Feasterly breeze, stronger along
OL,10,Fsouthern coasts.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FAfter
OL,13,Fa scattering of light showers on
OL,14,FThursday, it will remain largely dry
OL,15,Fand settled over the next few days,
OL,16,Fwith more in the way of cloud. Feeling
OL,17,Fcooler.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
